QUERY PLAN
╭─ FILTER ───────────────────────────╮
│ Expression: (a <= 4) OR (a >= 999) │
│ ~200 rows                          │
╰──────────────────┬─────────────────╯
╭─ SEQ_SCAN ───────┴─────────────────╮
│ Table: mp                          │
│ Type: Sequential Scan              │
│ Projections: a                     │
│ Column Filter:                     │
│ optional: ((a <= 4) OR (a >= 999)) │
│ ~1,000 rows                        │
╰────────────────────────────────────╯

query
SELECT a FROM mp WHERE NOT mp_between(a + 1, 5, 1000) ORDER BY a
