query
EXPLAIN SELECT count(*) FROM mp p JOIN mp q ON mp_eq(p.a + 1, q.b)
----
QUERY PLAN
╭─ UNGROUPED_AGGREGATE ────╮
│ Aggregates: count_star() │
│ ~1 row                   │
╰─────────────┬────────────╯
╭─ HASH_JOIN ─┴────────────╮
│ Join Type: INNER         │
│ Conditions: (a + 1) = b  │
│ ~1,000 rows              │
╰─────────────┬────────────╯
              ├───────────────────────────╮
╭─ SEQ_SCAN ──┴────────────╮  ╭─ SEQ_SCAN ┴───────────╮
│ Table: mp                │  │ Table: mp             │
│ Type: Sequential Scan    │  │ Type: Sequential Scan │
│ Projections: a           │  │ Projections: b        │
│ ~1,000 rows              │  │ ~1,000 rows           │
╰──────────────────────────╯  ╰───────────────────────╯

query
SELECT count(*) AS c FROM mp p JOIN mp q ON mp_eq(p.a + 1, q.b)
----
c
715

